\p{The next principle to consider, I like to call the \em{subtraction rule}.  In a sense, though, it is just a more sophisticated version of the addition rule.}

\transclude{00G9}   % Subtraction rule
\transclude{00GA}   % Lunches
\transclude{00GB}   % Bit strings
\transclude{00GC}   % PIE
